## Calendar invites reminder

Two deferred tracks in [SUMMER_PLAN_CALENDAR_INVITES_EXPLORATION.md](../../SUMMER_PLAN_CALENDAR_INVITES_EXPLORATION.md):

- **Track A (Booked):** pickup/dropoff ±30m — user-entered times + Schedule Notes in modal; see [PICKUP_DROPOFF_ICS_PLAN.md](../../PICKUP_DROPOFF_ICS_PLAN.md).
- **Track B (Want to book):** registration opens−30m — uses `Registration Opens Date` / `Registration Opens Time` from camp catalog; needs time parser + email/`.ics` + cron.
- **Track B MVP:** client `.ics` download + optional email via Resend — [REGISTRATION_ICS_PLAN.md](../../REGISTRATION_ICS_PLAN.md) (execute when requested); exploration [REGISTRATION_ICS_EXPLORATION.md](../../REGISTRATION_ICS_EXPLORATION.md).

Do **not** implement unless user requests. Resolve open questions in that doc first.
